@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - View Explainable Results
actor "User (Analyst)" as User
boundary ResultsUI
entity TaskResult
control ExplanationService
entity EvidenceRef
entity DataAsset

User -> ResultsUI : openResult(resultId)
ResultsUI -> TaskResult : load result
TaskResult --> ResultsUI : answer + confidence
ResultsUI -> ExplanationService : loadEvidence(result)
ExplanationService -> EvidenceRef : fetch evidence
EvidenceRef --> ExplanationService : evidenceRefs
ExplanationService --> ResultsUI : displayEvidence(evidenceRefs)
User -> ResultsUI : open evidence
ResultsUI -> ExplanationService : jumpToSource(evidenceRef)
ExplanationService -> DataAsset : open sourceAsset
DataAsset --> ExplanationService : page/timestamp
ExplanationService -> ExplanationService : saveAuditTrail()
ExplanationService --> ResultsUI : source location
ResultsUI --> User : display source reference
@enduml